    "name": "Swarm Hunter",
    "steam_appid": 3323610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1985. An Alternate Universe. A Forgotten World Calls for Help.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The International Space Agency (ISA) has just intercepted a desperate, system-wide distress signal from the long-isolated inhabitants of Pluto. In a race against time, the nearby vessel\u00a0<i>Empress of Discovery</i>\u00a0is dispatched to respond\u2026but moments after making orbit, the ship\u2019s final transmission crackles through the void: a garbled, static-soaked mayday\u2026 then silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, all eyes turn to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the role of Master Commander Lance Johnson, captain of the legendary\u00a0<i>Gilded Seeker</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: investigate the Plutonian distress call, uncover the fate of the\u00a0<i>Empress</i>\u00a0and its crew, and confront whatever terror has awakened on the planet\u2019s surface. Can you stop the unknown menace before it spreads beyond Pluto\u2019s orbit?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beam Down Into Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend from the\u00a0<i>Gilded Seeker</i>\u00a0and plunge straight into a hellscape of swarming alien horrors. Battle relentless waves of monstrous bugs overrunning the planet. Scavenge DNA, rescue stranded crew members, and unleash devastating orbital strikes from your ship. Experiment with wild synergies between powerful weapons and attunements to forge unstoppable bug-slaying builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obliterate the Swarm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through\u00a0five treacherous biomes, each teeming with twisted alien monstrosities, environmental hazards, and colossal bosses hellbent on ripping you apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/d15783515c5f6e9f7263ab54de0088f8.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/d15783515c5f6e9f7263ab54de0088f8.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/d15783515c5f6e9f7263ab54de0088f8.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade. Evolve. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DNA to supercharge your arsenal, upgrade ModBots, boost your stats, and unlock new weaponry. Every mission makes you stronger, deadlier, and better equipped to face the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/ad93581b2e3895fe3065de28d7d87499.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/ad93581b2e3895fe3065de28d7d87499.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/ad93581b2e3895fe3065de28d7d87499.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Call in the Cavalry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon crushing laser strikes, deploy your loyal BulletBuddy drone, and bring in supplies from orbit with strategic ModBot drops. Master the battlefield by combining air support with relentless firepower.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/cf7ed6dc77518e4a6723b93865447e1b.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/cf7ed6dc77518e4a6723b93865447e1b.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/cf7ed6dc77518e4a6723b93865447e1b.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue the Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down the missing crew of the\u00a0<i>Empress of Discovery</i>. Each survivor saved grants access to new weapons and critical intel to unravel the chilling mystery of what happened on Pluto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/75ae621c79be41fadb9da294170ed74d.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/75ae621c79be41fadb9da294170ed74d.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/75ae621c79be41fadb9da294170ed74d.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die. Upgrade. Return Stronger.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn\u2019t the end \u2014 it\u2019s fuel for your comeback. Return to the\u00a0<i>Gilded Seeker</i>, unlock permanent upgrades, grab new gear, and dive back in with a vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/80a1f519c88dce7969a436f1237beff7.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/80a1f519c88dce7969a436f1237beff7.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/80a1f519c88dce7969a436f1237beff7.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exterminate the Swarm. Save Pluto. Become a Legend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through monstrous hordes and towering bosses across five deadly biomes. Rescue the lost, reclaim Pluto, and crush the Swarm before it spreads to the rest of the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suit up, Commander. The fate of the outer colonies is in your hands.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/9a4afe883aa1fb217b7d83944c76bfa7.poster.avif?t=1753204354\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/9a4afe883aa1fb217b7d83944c76bfa7.webm?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323610/extras/9a4afe883aa1fb217b7d83944c76bfa7.mp4?t=1753204354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
